**Describe the bug** A clear and concise description of what the bug is.

Black is failing to format a file, and telling me to open an issue. I think this is related to usage of `# fmt: off`, `# fmt: on`

**To Reproduce** Steps to reproduce the behavior:

Running `black . --check --diff` on [this PR](https://github.com/theislab/anndata/pull/332), or just `black` on [this file](https://github.com/theislab/anndata/blob/9bae96d78d3587f1f71908335a924177558f6799/anndata/_core/index.py)

